# Docs metadata: README tables, SECURITY table and the "At a glance" box are generated from
# this (dev/gen-docs.py). One "key: value" per line.
emoji: 📜
name: Scroll strips
group: core
what: Big scroll strips beside each window, docked in the dashboard or floating (right and top by default), easy to grab with the laser. Drag along one to scroll; tap near an end to page. Position and thickness are set in the installer window.
why: Desktop scroll bars are sized for a mouse and hard to hit with a laser.
changes: One dashboard patch (`~/.local/share/frame-tweaks/vr-dashboard/patches/scroll-strips.js`) via VR dashboard patching (helper); settings in `~/.config/frame-tweaks/scroll-strips.json`
access: Through VR dashboard patching (helper): SteamVR's dashboard DevTools port while SteamVR runs; scrolls with a mouse wheel (XTest on the Steam session's display)
survives-updates: Yes; after a SteamVR update it checks SteamVR's dashboard code and switches itself off if that changed
undo: `./install.sh uninstall scroll-strips` (or untick it in the installer window; settings are kept)
